  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under Section 465(a), the at-risk rules apply to individuals and certain closely held corporations (including S corporations through their shareholders and personal service corporations). Widely held C corporations that are neither closely held nor personal service corporations are generally exempt from the at-risk limitations. (Sec. 465(a)(1).)
